1
00:00:00,045 --> 00:00:03,255
(Leonard:)Sheldon, have you ever once heard me say
that I don't trust Penny?

2
00:00:03,423 --> 00:00:05,343
(Leonard:)Sheldon? Where did he go?

3
00:00:05,509 --> 00:00:08,049
Ugh. Your yelling must've
freaked him out again.

4
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:11,100
(Leonard:)Where are you going? You just walk away
in the middle of an argument?

5
00:00:11,264 --> 00:00:12,764
No. I'm gonna find your roommate...

6
00:00:12,933 --> 00:00:16,273
(Penny:)...before he hurts himself
trying to cross the street or something.

7
00:00:16,436 --> 00:00:17,476
(Leonard:)Why didn't you say so?

8
00:00:17,646 --> 00:00:19,526
PENNY: Now I need your permission
for that too?

9
00:00:19,689 --> 00:00:21,189
(Leonard:)I can't read your mind, Penny.

10
00:00:21,358 --> 00:00:25,148
PENNY: Really? Why not?
You're so smart and I'm so dumb!

11
00:00:27,697 --> 00:00:30,697
Raj. Raj. Raj.

12
00:00:30,867 --> 00:00:33,457
RAJESH:
Stop knocking. It's open.

13
00:00:34,037 --> 00:00:36,497
(Raj:)Please tell my parents
that our dark matter research...

14
00:00:36,665 --> 00:00:40,415
...is at a critical juncture. I can't come
for my cousin Sanjay's wedding.

15
00:00:40,585 --> 00:00:43,715
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Ask our son what we're supposed
to say to Mr. and Mrs. Chaudri...

16
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:47,630
(Mrs Koothrappali:)...whose daughter, Lakshmi, is flying in
for the sole purpose of meeting him.

17
00:00:47,801 --> 00:00:49,471
(Raj:)I didn't ask you to set me up.

18
00:00:49,636 --> 00:00:53,636
(Mrs Koothrappali:)-You should be thanking us.
-Yes, Lakshmi got her stomach stapled.

19
00:00:54,558 --> 00:00:56,808
(Dr Koothrappali:)You have an opportunity
to get in with her...

20
00:00:56,977 --> 00:00:59,607
(Dr Koothrappali:)...before she loses weight
and her self-esteem goes up.

